      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>AS</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>The /CTDI/CL_PRINT_DRIVER_CTDI class is the custom print driver subclass</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT></TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE> for standard CTDI repairs. It implements the data retrieval and mapping</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT></TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE> lifecycle for CTDI Repair Reports.</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>U1</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>AS</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>This class redefines the protected action hooks to:</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>B1</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>- unpack_io_data: Extract CTDI-specific execution parameters.</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>B1</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>- fetch_data_from_db: Select repair and contract data via the CTDI</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT></TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>  data provider /CTDI/CL_PRINT_DATA_CTDI.</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>B1</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>- map_and_register_data: Map CTDI data structures and register form</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT></TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>  parameters for Smart Forms and Adobe Forms rendering.</TDLINE>
      </item>
     </LINES>
    </item>
    <item>
